# NOTE: genome paths use ${MIRROR_FNA_DIR} (set in config.sh). Regenerate the genomes
# with scripts/make_mirror_distance.py, which downloads them there.
# MIRROR set — species present in Kraken2 standard, ABSENT from RaPDTool's
# type-material database. Selected by make_mirror_set.py (--sample 10 --seed 42)
# from a pool of 10,973 prokaryotic species; stratified one per phylum.
# Purpose: characterise RaPDTool's OUT-OF-DOMAIN failure mode.
#
